{
  "feature": "Tuning hub, PR 1 and PR 2: the landing, the tool switch, the trim-line shortcut and History",
  "note": "Tuning hub handoff R1 canvas A (A1, A2, A4, A5, A6) plus the plan's no-reading row. Needs ANALYSIS_TAB_ENABLED, TUNING_ENABLED and PROPOSED_CUTS_ENABLED all 'true' (two tools on draws the hub), on a scratch branch holding a pull:staging copy, and four decks the signed-in account owns: HUB_PRIOR_RUN_DECK, a read deck with a Suggested changes run from an earlier visit; HUB_OVER_DECK, a read deck since built past 100; HUB_FULL_DECK, a read deck at 100; HUB_UNREAD_OVER_DECK, a deck past 100 that was never read. A3, a run in flight on its tile, needs a pending paid run and is covered by tuning-hub.test (the running tile, its elapsed time and the re-read).",
